                <pb facs="0285" n="217" sameAs="frus:frus1867p1/pg217"/>


                <head>Mrs. Lincoln to Mr. Dimon</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>375 <hi rendition="#small-caps">West Washington Street,
                                Chicago,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1866-12-27"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >December</hi> 27, 1866</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>In reply to the polite note of Mr. Dimon, Mrs. A. Lincoln would suggest the hour
                    of 2 this p. m. as most convenient to receive a call from him.</p>
            </div>
